&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Why User Behavior?&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer on the User Behavior ML Platform, you will build the data and serving foundation behind Roblox&#39;s user-level safety understanding, so that every safety system can see who a user is, not just what a single piece of content looks like.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the core ML platform for a new capability at Roblox: a safety user feature store, user embeddings, and risk scores that power personalized consequences, proactive detection, and early education. This is a rare opportunity to build foundational, high-scale ML systems that shape how Roblox understands and responds to risk across hundreds of millions of users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will feel a deep sense of responsibility building systems that directly affect millions of users, especially minors, on one of the world&#39;s largest platforms. Your work will reduce harm, improve fairness, and help ensure Roblox remains a place where creativity and community can thrive safely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You will:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the Safety User Feature Store: Design and operate the pipelines that turn violations, reports, appeals, filter activity, and engagement signals into reliable, well-documented user features for training and serving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve User Embeddings and Risk Scores: Take user embeddings and risk models from offline training to production, including low-latency online lookup and similar-user search for detection teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the Real-Time Path: Extend batch pipelines to streaming, so fresh behavioral signals reach models and downstream safety systems within minutes, not days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable ML Teams to Move Fast: Partner with MLEs and Data Scientists to provide self-serve tooling for feature discovery, training data generation, offline evaluation, and A/B experiment hooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Data Quality and Governance: Build monitoring for feature freshness, drift, lineage, and ownership, so teams across Safety can trust and reuse signals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design for Trust and Auditability: Build systems that support explainability, fairness review, and appeals correction, since these signals directly shape consequences for millions of users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ship Code, Not Just Designs: Own end-to-end delivery, from system design through migration, testing, production operation, and oncall.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You have:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience building and operating production ML platforms, data infrastructure, or large-scale backend systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with batch and streaming data pipelines (e.g., Spark, Flink, Kafka) feeding feature stores or similar ingestion layers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing low-latency serving systems: service APIs (RPC/gRPC), key-value storage, caching, and high-throughput read paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python and a statically-typed backend language (Go, Java, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid production operations fundamentals: monitoring, alerting, oncall, and incident response for systems with real user-facing impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort partnering with ML engineers, with a working understanding of the model lifecycle: training data generation, offline evaluation, deployment, and drift monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Trust &amp;amp; Safety, content moderation, user detection, or other adversarial domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with user-level modeling or user understanding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with embeddings and vector similarity search in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with feature store platforms and signal governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building agentic workflows or tool interfaces for LLM agents (e.g., MCP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You are:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Systems Thinker: capable of designing platforms that ML and detection teams build on, not just point solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Pragmatic Builder: scrappy and impact-oriented, comfortable turning scattered, undocumented signals into clean, well-owned data products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with Ambiguity: this space is still being defined, and you will help set the standard rather than follow an existing one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Reliability-Minded Engineer: you treat data quality, testing, migrations, and oncall as first-class parts of the job.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Strong Collaborator: you work effectively across ML, Policy, Product, and Detection teams, and make the people around you faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Committed to Ethical, Responsible Engineering: dedicated to building systems that are fair, auditable, and operate with the utmost responsibility toward user safety.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$196,750&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$243,290 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpaca is a US-headquartered, global leader in agent-first brokerage infrastructure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for stocks, ETFs, options, crypto, fixed income, 24/5 trading, and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Amongst our subsidiaries, Alpaca is a licensed financial services company, serving hundreds of financial institutions across 40 countries with our institutional-grade APIs. This includes broker-dealers, investment advisors, wealth managers, hedge funds, and crypto exchanges, totalling over 10 million brokerage accounts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our global team is a diverse group of experienced engineers, traders, and brokerage professionals who are working to achieve our mission of opening financial services to everyone on the planet. We&#39;re deeply committed to open-source contributions and fostering a vibrant community, continuously enhancing our award-winning, developer-friendly API and the robust infrastructure behind it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpaca is proudly backed by $400 million in funding from top-tier global investors including Portage Ventures, Spark Capital, Tribe Capital, Social Leverage, Horizons Ventures, Opera Tech Ventures, SBI Group, Derayah Financial, Unbound, Peak XV, Elefund, and Y Combinator.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Team Members:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a dynamic team of 400+ globally distributed members who thrive working from our favorite places around the world, with teammates spanning the USA, Canada, Japan, Hungary, Nigeria, Brazil, the UK, and beyond!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re searching for passionate individuals eager to contribute to Alpaca&#39;s rapid growth. If you align with our core values—Stay Curious, Have Empathy, and Be Accountable—and are ready to make a significant impact, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to build the developer platform that agents and partners use to integrate and build on. You evolve Alpaca’s API standards, governance, documentation and the SDKs, CLI, MCPs and other AI tools for end users to build, integrate and operate on Alpaca.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You play a central role to define the API and the tooling that makes Alpaca the easiest and fastest trading infrastructure to build, integrate and operate on. You ensure the Developer and Agent surfaces are consistent, reliable, secure, and easy to evolve. You will also build backend systems that will power API experiences across the end users journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on role. You will lead through architecture, code, design reviews, and mentorship. You will partner with Product, Compliance, Risk, and Platform Engineering teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Things You Get To Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the developer and agent platform for developers and partners to integrate and build on top of Alpaca, including SDK/CLI/MCP architecture and API design and evolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build backend systems that will power API experiences across the end users journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to API standardization, versioning, security, governance and documentation across external APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and evolve services responsible for API governance and the developer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive best practices for observability, performance, and reliability at the application layer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review API and architectural designs across teams and guide complex technical decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to shared frameworks, libraries, and tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor senior engineers and raise the bar for backend and API craftsmanship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are (Must-Haves):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of software engineering experience, with ownership of production systems that other developers use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shipped a developer-facing API, SDK, or developer platform as a primary contributor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in API design, including schemas, compatibility, and responses other developers can rely on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Golang, C# or Java (or equivalent backend experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of observability and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining and influencing engineering standards across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong architectural judgment and ability to balance long-term design with delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with frontend systems (React/TypeScript) and API consumption patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Algo trading experience (either professional or personal).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Might Be (Nice-to-Haves):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with MCP architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with agent identity, authorization and safety, such as OAuth, delegated access and policy enforcement systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience or understanding of financial markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production experience with Go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working at a startup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working remotely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Take Care of You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary &amp;amp; Stock Options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Health Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;New Hire Home-Office Setup: One-time USD $500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Monthly Stipend: USD $150 per month via a Brex Card&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Alpaca is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace dedicated to pursuing and hiring a diverse workforce.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://files.alpaca.markets/disclosures/AlpacaRecruitmentPrivacyPolicy.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;Learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Datastores team owns Coinbase&#39;s production online databases and caches: Aurora, RDS Postgres, MongoDB Atlas, DynamoDB, ElastiCache (Valkey, Redis), and ClickHouse. We build the paved paths, tooling, and client libraries that let hundreds of engineering teams run reliable, secure, cost-efficient data layers serving millions of requests per second. We are hiring a Staff Software Engineer to help evolve our storage platform: consolidating how databases are provisioned and operated, building zonal resilience and disaster recovery into every production datastore, securing access to data, and giving teams well-paved ways to use it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the architecture and multi-year roadmap of Coinbase&#39;s storage platform across relational, document, key-value, and caching datastores.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead platform initiatives from design through production, such as consolidating databases onto shared, proxy-fronted clusters and building client libraries that make applications resilient to failover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive resilience and disaster recovery for online datastores: zonal failover, backups and replication, restore tooling, and regular recovery validation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Harden the security and compliance posture of our datastores: encryption and key management, least-privilege access, audit logging, and the controls and evidence that regulators and auditors expect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design for reliability, performance, and cost efficiency; set and defend SLOs, lead capacity planning, and eliminate recurring classes of incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior engineers and product-group leadership on database technology choices, and work directly with AWS, MongoDB, and other vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers across the team, raise the bar on design reviews and operational excellence, and participate in the on-call rotation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Required Skills and Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of industry experience building and operating large-scale, highly available distributed systems in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep hands-on experience operating online databases at scale in production (e.g., PostgreSQL/Aurora, MongoDB, DynamoDB, Redis/Valkey, Memcached), including replication, failover, performance tuning, and version upgrades.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of distributed database architecture, consistency models, and the trade-offs between datastore technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience securing data infrastructure in a regulated environment: encryption at rest and in transit, key management, access control, and audit requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong backend development skills in Go, Java, or Python, with a track record of building database tooling, client libraries, or automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading cross-team technical initiatives, writing clear design documents, and influencing without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency Notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Base salary varies by location (see range below). Total compensation may also include equity and bonus eligibility, and benefits (medical, dental, vision, 401(k)).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual base salary range (excluding equity and bonus):&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$218,025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$256,500 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Application Limit: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Candidates may submit a maximum of 3 applications within a 6-month period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer: &lt;/strong&gt;Coinbase is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, protected veteran status, or genetic information. Applicants with criminal histories will be considered consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Applicants: &lt;/strong&gt;View&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppac.pdf&quot;&gt; Employee Rights&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt; Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://static-assets.coinbase.com/e-verify.pdf&quot;&gt; E-Verify&lt;/a&gt; Notice of Participation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations: &lt;/strong&gt;If you are an individual with a disability who needs a reasonable accommodation, email us your request and contact info at accommodations[at]coinbase.com.&amp;nbsp;Need screen reading technology?&lt;a href=&quot;https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/screen-reader/kgejglhpjiefppelpmljglcjbhoiplfn&quot;&gt; Click here&lt;/a&gt; to download a free compatible screen reader and view the&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.chromevox.com/tutorial/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;tutorial&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy &amp;amp; Arbitration: &lt;/strong&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/applicant_privacy_notice&quot;&gt; Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. US applicants: By submitting your application, you agree to&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/application-arbitration-agreement&quot;&gt; Arbitration of Disputes&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Datadog&#39;s Implementation Services team leads end-to-end deployment and optimization projects. Our FDEs own the discovery, design, and build of the Datadog platform to help customers accelerate time to value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Forward Deployed Engineer, you&#39;ll be the hands-on technical engine behind our most complex engagements. You&#39;ll work directly in customer environments to deploy Datadog, migrate customers off legacy platforms, and optimize existing deployments. You&#39;ll also partner with our Product and Engineering teams on design partnerships with strategic customers adopting new Datadog products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical planning, design, and execution of migration, optimization, and observability transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with customer teams to understand their requirements and support their adoption of your solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure build efforts, with consideration of complexity and timeline constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy and configure Datadog across cloud environments, Kubernetes clusters, and on-prem infrastructure, using Terraform, Ansible, and CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn ad hoc tools into reusable patterns that accelerate future projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead design partnerships with strategic customers adopting new Datadog products, and support a clear feedback loop with Product and Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 8+ years in software engineering, SRE, DevOps, platform engineering, or customer-facing technical roles such as professional services or solutions engineering with a strong foundational understanding of best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to architect solutions, get buy in on design, and drive build work to completion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You write and operate production-quality code or automation in Python, Go, TypeScript, or similar, and you default to scripting repetitive work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with React&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know at least one major cloud well (AWS, GCP or Azure), along with strong fundamentals in Kubernetes, Terraform or Ansible, and CI/CD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have hands-on observability experience with Datadog or a comparable platform, and understand how monitoring, logging, and tracing work in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You use AI coding tools daily and switch between customer delivery and heads-down building without needing the day structured for you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to sit up to 4 hours, traveling to and from client sites&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to travel via auto, train or air up to 30% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your skills, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Growth:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Best-in-breed onboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous global benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intra-departmental mentor and buddy program for in-house networking&lt;/li&gt;
